.SS "bool Assimp::ExportProperties::GetPropertyBool (const char * szName, bool bErrorReturn = \fRfalse\fP) const\fR [inline]\fP"
Get a boolean configuration property\&. Boolean properties are stored on the integer stack internally so it's possible to set them via \fBSetPropertyBool\fP and query them with \fBGetPropertyBool\fP and vice versa\&. 
.PP
